{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "8a588f0a-8537-8731-a58a-f3f399613240",
  "created_at": "2026-02-03T11:05:44-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Colin Donovan",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:02:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:02:40-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, Greg. Colin Donovan. I've got a question about a short-term rental license, and I'm not sure I'm even in the right department."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:02:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You might be. What's the situation?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:02:52-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So, I'm renting a house at 74 Ocean Avenue, the Ocean Drive side. Just for two months, February and March. It's a winter thing. Now, the owner's not living there. I'm the one staying. Is that a short-term rental? Because I read something online and now I'm less sure than when I started."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:03:10-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Who's renting to who? Are you the guest, or are you renting it out to other people?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:03:17-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um. I'm the guest. I think. The owner's renting it to me, for two months. I'm not renting it to anybody."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:03:25-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Then the license question is really the owner's, not yours. Generally the owner is the one who needs to be licensed if they rent a place for short stays. You'd just be the tenant."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:03:37-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, but is two months short? The website said something about thirty days, or maybe it was ninety. I couldn't tell if it was a minimum or a maximum."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:03:48-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can't tell you offhand where that line sits for the license, and I don't want you walking away with the wrong number. I can check with the licensing side. But the main thing is, ask the owner whether they've got the license or whether they think they need one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:04:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I don't apply for anything. The owner does."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Most likely, yes. If the owner does need to apply, they're the one filing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Sort of. And if they do, how long does approval take? Roughly. I'm moving in the fifteenth, so I'd like to know if I should be nervous."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:04:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on the application and whether the inspection side has to come out. Could be a couple of weeks, could be longer. Winter's slower for some things, but I wouldn't promise you a date. If the owner hasn't started, the fifteenth is tight."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Tight. Great. That's a word I enjoy hearing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:04:44-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Have the owner call us directly. We can walk them through it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:04:49-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll do that. One more thing, and this is unrelated to the license. I play the accordion. Not professionally. But I'll be practicing in the evenings, so I'm apologizing in advance to the neighbors. Is there something I need to tell somebody about that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "[pause] No, you don't register an accordion with us. Just keep it reasonable at night. If a neighbor complains, that goes through the police for noise, not this office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:05:14-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Reasonable. I'll try to play only the sad songs quietly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:05:18-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's your call. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:05:21-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So just to be sure I have it right. The owner applies, not me, and nobody can tell me how long it takes. Is that fair?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:05:31-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Close. Owner applies if it's needed, and the timing depends on the application. Have them call and ask."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:05:38-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I think I've got it. Mostly. Thanks, Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-03T11:05:42-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You bet. Take care."
    }
  ],
